msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Aaagh! What's yer deal, anyway...? Did ya come here to get Kishimoto outta "
"his loan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "No, I'm not trying to get him off the hook."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "I just want you to give him an interest rate he can actually pay back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr "Cosa...?"

msgctxt "112"
msgid "If you borrow money, you pay it back. That's how it works."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"So, wouldn't it be better for both of you if Kishimoto actually paid you "
"back, instead of trying to commit suicide or file for bankruptcy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Well, yeah. I guess you're right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Also, his friend's loan has nothing to do with him. Let him out of being the"
" guarantor for that loan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "After all, he didn't sign anything. It's not like he's legally bound."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"How do you know so much about these things? What are ya, some kind of hot-"
"shot loan shark yerself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"I used to work in a similar line of business. Now then, I'll be keeping an "
"eye on you."
msgstr ""

